OL,3,GNEWSANew community bus 'a lifeline' for
OL,4,Arural towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new community mini-bus service has
OL,7,Fstarted in a rural county, running
OL,8,Fthree days per week.
OL,10,FFrom 2 September, the Three Castles
OL,11,FShuttle service connects Bishop's
OL,12,FCastle with Ludlow, passing through
OL,13,Ftowns, including Clun and Craven Arms.
OL,15,FPassengers can guarantee their spot on
OL,16,Fthe wheelchair-accessible bus by
OL,17,Fpre-booking a seat.
OL,19,FNeil Langford, from Shrewsbury
OL,20,FDial-A-Ride, which is running the
OL,21,Fservice, said the route "really is a
OL,22,Flifeline for people".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
